  "steps": {
    "zh_CN": "1. 先唱唱名，再用 a 唱整句。\n2. 加入「轻轻唱，听见声音」。\n3. 「啊」后面的两音继续同一元音，不添新字。\n4. 录音检查旋律；咬字与歌词内容通过回放自查。",
    "en_US": "1. Sing solfege, then the phrase on a.\n2. Add the Chinese practice lyrics shown on the score.\n3. Continue the vowel after 啊 through the next two notes.\n4. Review pitch; use replay to check words and articulation."
  },
